sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Scan + runner
  participant Q as Reporter state
  participant H as Receiver API
  participant A as Public ACK
  S->>S: collect diagnostics and validate report
  S->>Q: save report then ACK metadata (separate files)
  Note over S,Q: Current default v5-v9 scan emits empty ACK list
  S->>Q: enqueue validated bytes and optional fixed ACK bundle
  Q->>Q: duplicate / capacity checks, temp then rename
  S->>Q: flush with PID lock
  Q->>H: original report POST (10s)
  alt accepted and matching report ID
    opt supplied nonempty ACK bundle
      Q->>A: allowlisted command / cursor (10s each)
      A-->>Q: validated acknowledgement
    end
    Q->>Q: delete original and retry / manifest
    Q-->>S: flush outcome
    S->>S: finalize receipt after flush success
  else ordinary v9 413 with split contract
    Q->>Q: persist fixed manifest and original bytes
    Q->>H: fragments with fixed IDs / hashes
    H-->>Q: 202 fragment stored (not complete)
    H-->>Q: 200 complete / matching report hash
    Note over Q,A: ACK and delete only after whole acceptance
  else unavailable / rejected / ACK failed
    Q->>Q: keep + retry, dead-letter, or controlled hold
    Q-->>S: nonzero with partial outcome
  end
  Note over S,H: Local receipt does not observe receiver UI
